{"text":"永平三年五月十日，道人惠感敬造世加文佛一區。願四大布福，爲皇帝隆復，爲七世父母、所生父母。","tags":[{"name":"Udef_Buddhist_Term","term":"道人","refId":null,"text":"道人","start":9,"end":11},{"name":"PersonName","term":"惠感","refId":null,"text":"惠感","start":11,"end":13},{"name":"Udef_Buddhist_Term","term":"釋迦","refId":null,"text":"世加","start":15,"end":17}]}